{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/K\u00e9perny\u0151k\u00e9p_2025-04-17_160515.png?t=1745622472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every sound matters. Every shadow <i>hides a question</i>. From the howling wind to distant footsteps, Ravenhill <i>builds tension</i> through silence and isolation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/K\u00e9perny\u0151k\u00e9p_2025-04-17_161709.png?t=1745622472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Track a <i>deadly beast</i> using your instincts and tools. But be warned - it learns, it stalks, and it's <i>not alone</i> in the dark.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/K\u00e9perny\u0151k\u00e9p_2025-03-31_223319.png?t=1745622472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Delve into the truth behind the <i>Ravens</i>, a hidden cult that once ruled the village. Discover what they worshipped - and what they <i>awakened</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/K\u00e9perny\u0151k\u00e9p_2025-04-17_161152.png?t=1745622472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>From fog-covered graveyards to ancient forest altars, <i>each biome holds its own atmosphere</i>, threats, and secrets to uncover. No two areas feel the same - exploration is as <i>dangerous</i> as it is <i>rewarding</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/K\u00e9perny\u0151k\u00e9p_2025-04-17_161641.png?t=1745622472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Repair ancient relics, use your environment wisely, and manage your <i>limited resources</i>. Every decision <i>matters</i> when you're being hunted.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/K\u00e9perny\u0151k\u00e9p_2025-04-17_161030.png?t=1745622472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Freely <i>explore</i> the village and surrounding forest in search of clues, tools, and hidden paths. But some doors only open with blood.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trade with a <i>mysterious forest merchant</i> who appears only when the mist is thick. Buy rare tools, sacred relics, and cursed items - if you're willing to pay the price.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678080?t=1745622472","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/579106b0abe3c15aab5a384bb7f427d31a703044/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745622472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/81efc3f3bf53a60269790f1fc49818bfb6ab02b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745622472","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/81efc3f3bf53a60269790f1fc49818bfb6ab02b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745622472","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/K\u00e9perny\u0151k\u00e9p_2025-04-17_160515.png?t=1745622472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every sound matters. Every shadow <i>hides a question</i>. From